{"4388130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wendigo Land : Survive The Legend", "steam_appid": 4388130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Freedom has a price. For you, it’s 1,000,000.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wendigo Land : Survive The Legend</strong>, you are a desperate debtor dragged to a forgotten, mysterious island by a creditor who knows no mercy. Your objective is simple but deadly: scavenge the island’s hidden treasures to settle a staggering <strong>1,000,000</strong> debt and buy back your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you aren't the only hunter in these woods. Survival is a brutal gamble on an island swarming with lethal predators and ancient horrors. Worst of all, the legendary <strong>Wendigo</strong>—a ravenous, mythical demon—stalks your every move, waiting for the perfect moment to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you clear your tab and escape, or will the island claim your soul as interest?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/e69b6dcfc4f6c43d879f3b4e81cf8070.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/e69b6dcfc4f6c43d879f3b4e81cf8070.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/e69b6dcfc4f6c43d879f3b4e81cf8070.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op Survival:</strong> Team up with up to 4 friends. Work together to clear the debt, or watch each other's backs as the shadows close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/be1a4e1c74007a9e6a6cac37143d423c.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=798 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/be1a4e1c74007a9e6a6cac37143d423c.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/be1a4e1c74007a9e6a6cac37143d423c.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting:</strong> Gather materials to build a fortified sanctuary. Set traps and strengthen your defenses to survive the brutal nights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/9d3cd533fbe30ba2b8c2a5d3aa8c2804.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/9d3cd533fbe30ba2b8c2a5d3aa8c2804.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/9d3cd533fbe30ba2b8c2a5d3aa8c2804.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining &amp; Scavenging:</strong> Venture into dangerous caves to mine rare ores and uncover hidden treasures. High risks lead to high rewards towards your 1,000,000 goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/97682f2c401cd3662315069ac62a8c90.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/97682f2c401cd3662315069ac62a8c90.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/97682f2c401cd3662315069ac62a8c90.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt or Be Hunted:</strong> Evade the legendary <strong>Wendigo</strong>, a ravenous creature of myth that stalks the forest. Sound and light attract it—stay quiet, or stay dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/7dd44b0f406003d48986ad7d61ba8b16.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/7dd44b0f406003d48986ad7d61ba8b16.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/7dd44b0f406003d48986ad7d61ba8b16.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you pay off the 1,000,000, or will your debt be settled in blood?</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Freedom has a price. For you, it’s 1,000,000.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wendigo Land : Survive The Legend</strong>, you are a desperate debtor dragged to a forgotten, mysterious island by a creditor who knows no mercy. Your objective is simple but deadly: scavenge the island’s hidden treasures to settle a staggering <strong>1,000,000</strong> debt and buy back your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you aren't the only hunter in these woods. Survival is a brutal gamble on an island swarming with lethal predators and ancient horrors. Worst of all, the legendary <strong>Wendigo</strong>—a ravenous, mythical demon—stalks your every move, waiting for the perfect moment to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you clear your tab and escape, or will the island claim your soul as interest?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/e69b6dcfc4f6c43d879f3b4e81cf8070.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/e69b6dcfc4f6c43d879f3b4e81cf8070.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/e69b6dcfc4f6c43d879f3b4e81cf8070.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-op Survival:</strong> Team up with up to 4 friends. Work together to clear the debt, or watch each other's backs as the shadows close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/be1a4e1c74007a9e6a6cac37143d423c.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=798 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/be1a4e1c74007a9e6a6cac37143d423c.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/be1a4e1c74007a9e6a6cac37143d423c.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building &amp; Crafting:</strong> Gather materials to build a fortified sanctuary. Set traps and strengthen your defenses to survive the brutal nights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/9d3cd533fbe30ba2b8c2a5d3aa8c2804.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/9d3cd533fbe30ba2b8c2a5d3aa8c2804.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/9d3cd533fbe30ba2b8c2a5d3aa8c2804.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining &amp; Scavenging:</strong> Venture into dangerous caves to mine rare ores and uncover hidden treasures. High risks lead to high rewards towards your 1,000,000 goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/97682f2c401cd3662315069ac62a8c90.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/97682f2c401cd3662315069ac62a8c90.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/97682f2c401cd3662315069ac62a8c90.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt or Be Hunted:</strong> Evade the legendary <strong>Wendigo</strong>, a ravenous creature of myth that stalks the forest. Sound and light attract it—stay quiet, or stay dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/7dd44b0f406003d48986ad7d61ba8b16.poster.avif?t=1779268577\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/7dd44b0f406003d48986ad7d61ba8b16.webm?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/extras/7dd44b0f406003d48986ad7d61ba8b16.mp4?t=1779268577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you pay off the 1,000,000, or will your debt be settled in blood?</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Pay 1M or Die! As a desperate debtor, survive a cursed island to repay a ruthless creditor. Scavenge treasure while evading lethal beasts and the ravenous Wendigo. Will you settle your tab or pay with your life? Survival is the only way out in Wendigo Land : Survive The Legend!", "supported_languages": "English, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/f5e094246755d17843bf71410bf328fa31c73905/header.jpg?t=1779268577", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/ea9a0df7c722187ec29bb3d93b0795b0d58c7c4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779268577", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388130/ea9a0df7c722187ec29bb3d93b0795b0d58c7c4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779268577", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3UfPH3lT93VR1PMXhLgKaw", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4430 /